    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "tb-rule-is-path",
        "moduleId": "rule-to-address",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材：URL 规则就是访问路径",
        "markdown": "教材指出，你可以自由修改传入 `app.route` 装饰器的 URL 规则字符串，但要注意以斜线 `/` 作为开头。\n\nURL 规则写在装饰器里，和紧随其后的视图函数绑定：浏览器访问的路径由这串规则决定，页面内容由该函数返回。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-e0a0d38f117bfe9c05dd311f",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000020"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "第 2 章：Hello, Flask!",
                "修改 URL 规则"
              ],
              "lineStart": 137,
              "lineEnd": 145,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "ea3584091cbadc90fda378a065e8b34972732a62923aabf34200a6628ca97b4f"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-address-demo",
        "moduleId": "rule-to-address",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "模型补充：把 / 改成 /home",
        "markdown": "下面把原来的根地址规则换成 `/home`：\n\n```python\n@app.route('/home')\ndef index():\n    return '<h1>Hello, Flask!</h1>'\n```\n\n保存后只有访问 http://localhost:5000/home 才能看到这行返回值；根地址 `/` 已经不在这条规则里了。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-rule-is-path"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-404",
        "moduleId": "rule-to-address",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "warning",
        "title": "教材：刷新旧地址会看到 404",
        "markdown": "教材记录了这个实验的结果：保存修改后直接刷新浏览器，会看到一个 404 错误提示，提示页面未找到（Page Not Found）。\n\n原因是视图函数的 URL 改成了 `/home`，而刷新后访问的地址仍然是旧的 `/`。把访问地址改成 http://localhost:5000/home，就会正确看到返回值。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
